{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"储能","country":"南非","country_iso":"ZAF","created_at":"2026-03-23T09:49:37.723393","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"ZAF-ES-0001","ldc":"No","location":"北开普省","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"南非红沙153MW/612MWh电池储能项目","project_name_en":"South Africa Red Sand 153MW/612MWh Battery Energy Storage Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"中国能建","content":"当地时间6月21日，2025年非洲能源论坛期间，中国能建与英国独立发电商Globeleq签署非洲单体规模最大电池储能电站——南非红沙153MW/612MWh电池储能项目EPC合同，实现了南非市场新突破。\n签约现场\n项目位于南非北开普省阿平顿市东南约100公里，是南非首轮电池储能独立发电商采购计划项目之一。工程内容包括储能电站系统、升压站、开关站、变电站以及配套线路等，项目签约即生效。作为南非新能源市场的旗舰工程，项目投产后将助力优化南非能源结构、提升电网稳定性，成为非洲储能产业发展的重要示范工程。\n作为非洲能源行业极具影响力的年度盛会，2025年非洲能源论坛吸引了非洲各国政府机构、公用事业单位以及国际能源开发商、金融机构、供应商和服务商。作为全球能源电力和基础设施行业领军企业，中国能建受邀参加，并携“四新”能建方案亮相，参会各方围绕新能源、储能、输变电、燃气电站等清洁能源业务领域的务实合作进行了深入交流与探讨。","content_sha256":"f39773b63c80ff9e7f6268a13143650281a44e9b037c61070974d2ee88203ddb","id":3076,"publish_date":"2025-06-26 11:04:03","title":"中国能建签约非洲单体最大电池储能项目","title_sha256":"3417a9e19b054ce141e6baf62370f374ab58ce3ad06caeb6754401c00c19f117","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/84448.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"ZAF-ES-0001","capacity_details":"BESS: 153MW/612MWh","capacity_mw":153.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"153","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:49:37.723602","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"ZAF-ES-0001-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"http://www.intl.ceec.net.cn/art/2025/6/26/art_55165_2514299.html\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"Globeleq","projec